<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on trading sector.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on trading sector.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products</p>
<p>(Guernsey) Ltd has issued two million European-style call</p>
<p>warrants, in two equal tranches, on a trading sector basket</p>
<p>comprising Itochu Corp, Mitsui &amp; Co, Marubeni</p>
<p>Corp, Mitsubishi Corp and Sumi Corp, lead</p>
<p>manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE		ISS PRICE</p>
<p> CALL A	  4,390.00 YEN	$3.418</p>
<p> CALL B	  4,829.00 YEN	$2.285</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   09.JUN.98		 PAYDATE	19.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
